{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2019-12", "window": 3, "start_date": 1576454400, "end_date": 1577145599, "month_true_total": 1597, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:20:34 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "60420807", "author": {"steamid": "76561198090995345", "personaname": "13k", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198090995345/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 27156, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11994, "last_played": 1735036354, "avatar": "f99b41e760b196c78e5ffd930e465c974fa12e7d"}, "language": "english", "review": "So I've spend almost 200h in this game and its gonna be more!\n\nIt's a fun coop game with four different classes with different skills. If you play with three friends, or strangers and everyone knows what to do, its just great how good the classes can work together. \nYou can unlock more weapons (I'd like to see more unlockable weapons) and perk points. \nThe levels are randomly generated and never feel the same and btw. look just so cool when you enter a big open space!\nThere are four different game modes and the \"new\" deep dive missions. So theres plenty of stuff to do.\nYou can also customize your character with gold or materials you get from the missions.\nThe lenght of the missions can vary a lot, depending on how the game generated the level. Sometimes it's easier to get to the materials and sometimes harder. You also can decide by yourself when you want to finish the mission. Sometimes it really pays off to keep digging, even when you have already all the stuff you need to finish.\n\nSo, if your looking for a shooter you can play with friends your dang right here!\nDont expect to much of story or cutscenes or anything like that. \nThis is purely made for the fun and thats all it needs!\n\nBy the beard!", "timestamp_created": 1577142621, "timestamp_updated": 1577142621, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "60418422", "author": {"steamid": "76561198014565674", "personaname": "sheepshank", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sheepshank/", "num_games_owned": 520, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 13971, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 496, "last_played": 1726523377, "avatar": "3d333bac75c9eb2047c897aee8d786e4d456a3c1"}, "language": "english", "review": "like vermintide, but with mining and less butt-rapey", "timestamp_created": 1577139653, "timestamp_updated": 1577139653, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "60417949", "author": {"steamid": "76561197973607588", "personaname": "Sam", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/samueldev/", "num_games_owned": 193, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 5252, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2429, "last_played": 1675749002, "avatar": "1bc965e4557f071b4605db44f6cb8d98991f58e7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Haven't had this much fun with a co-op game in ages. Thanks Ghost Ship team!", "timestamp_created": 1577139106, "timestamp_updated": 1577139106, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_d